            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 22,
              "start": 22
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice O'CONNOR, now, this ad could have been run by your clients by a segregated fund."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "CHIEF JUSTICE ROBERTS",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "f4f3ef01bb595392a58ff27afef859122337f9db341c9ae515ed6bab630072dd",
