            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 26,
              "start": 26
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to CHIEF JUSTICE ROBERTS, is there any other case that you can cite where we've upheld a facial challenge and then later said that an as\u2011applied challenge was barred by our ruling on the facial challenge?"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "f4f3ef01bb595392a58ff27afef859122337f9db341c9ae515ed6bab630072dd",
            "evidence_ids": [
