            "pages": {
              "end": 46,
              "start": 46
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Ginsburg, may I ask you one other thing about the setting? When you went to the Web site to get further information, what was conveyed about Senator Feingold when you went to get that further information?"
      }
