        "text": "According to Wisconsin Right to Life, Inc., the case concerns a First Amendment issue about whether the government can restrict grassroots lobbying about upcoming congressional votes through campaign finance laws."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Wisconsin Right to Life, Inc.",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "f4f3ef01bb595392a58ff27afef859122337f9db341c9ae515ed6bab630072dd",
