            "pages": {
              "end": 3,
              "start": 3
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Wisconsin Right to Life, Inc., the Court has distinguished regulation of corporate electioneering from grassroots lobbying, finding compelling governmental interests in regulating electioneering but not in restricting grassroots lobbying."
      }
